  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of five years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The window in the south-west elevation at first floor level shall be permanently maintained in non-openable obscured glazing. All rooflights shall be permanently maintained in obscured glazing.",
    "Condition : 3 - Notwithstanding the provisions of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development Order) 1995 (or any order revoking or re-enacting that order) no enlargement of the premises , any additional structures/buildings within the curtilage of the site, or any additional windows shall be carried out.",
    "Condition : 4 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority (before the building(s) is/are occupied/used).",
    "Condition : 5 - The stable block shown on drawing no. 12.p.01 Rev A  shall be used only for a purpose incidental to the enjoyment of the dwellinghouse at 12a Spring Grove.",
    "Condition : 6 - Before the development commences details of parking  shall be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority and the spaces shown on the approved drawing shall be available for use before first occupation of any part of the development."
